,"imageAlt":"The Taj Mahal and its reflecting pool in Agra","gallery":[],"highlights":["Explore the UNESCO World Heritage Sites of the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort.","Learn about the monuments with insights from a private professional tour guide.","Travel to and from Jaipur in a private air-conditioned car.","Admire the imposing red sandstone architecture of Agra Fort.","Visit the majestic Taj Mahal and explore its white marble architecture.","Enjoy a same-day trip with airport or hotel pickup and drop-off in Jaipur."],"itinerary":[{"label":"Stop 1","title":"Pickup in Jaipur and Drive to Agra","description":"Your chauffeur will meet you at your given location in Jaipur between 6 am and 8 am, or at your preferred time.\n\nRelax during the approximately 4–5 hour journey to Agra in a comfortable private air-conditioned car."},{"label":"Stop 2","title":"Meet Your Guide and Visit the Taj Mahal","description":"Upon arrival in Agra, meet your professional tour guide and proceed to the Taj Mahal for an approximately 2–3 hour visit.\n\nLearn about the white marble mausoleum built by Shah Jahan beside the Yamuna River as the resting place of his wife, Mumtaz Mahal. Explore its exterior and interior, admiring the intricate carvings and decorative stonework."},{"label":"Stop 3","title":"Optional Lunch Break","description":"After exploring the Taj Mahal, you can stop for a lunch break before continuing to Agra Fort. Lunch is at your own expense."},{"label":"Stop 4","title":"Agra Fort","description":"Explore Agra Fort with your tour guide and learn about its association with Emperor Akbar and its role as a residence of the Mughal emperors before the capital moved to Delhi.\n\nAdmire its red sandstone buildings, imposing walls, gateways, and riverside setting."},{"label":"Stop 5","title":"Return to Jaipur and Drop-off","description":"After your guided visits, travel back to Jaipur in your private air-conditioned car. Your chauffeur will drop you at your hotel, the airport, or your given location."}],"inclusions":["Transportation by private air-conditioned car","Experienced licensed driver","Services of a professional tour guide in Agra","Airport or hotel pickup and drop-off","Packaged drinking water bottles in the car","Car parking and airport parking","Toll taxes, fuel, and driver allowance"],"exclusions":["Lunch and dinner","Any optional trip","Monument entrance fees and camera fees","Anything not specified under the inclusions"],"faqs":[{"question":"How long is the Private Same Day Taj Mahal Tour From Jaipur?","answer":"The tour is planned for approximately 12–14 hours, including round-trip travel between Jaipur and Agra and guided visits to the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort. The total duration may vary with traffic and sightseeing time."},{"question":"Where and when does the tour start?","answer":"Your chauffeur will collect you from your given location in Jaipur between 6 am and 8 am, or at your preferred time."},{"question":"How long is the drive from Jaipur to Agra?","answer":"The drive takes approximately 4–5 hours each way."},{"question":"Where will I meet my tour guide?","answer":"You will meet your professional tour guide upon arrival in Agra before visiting the Taj Mahal."},{"question":"Which monuments are included in the itinerary?","answer":"The itinerary covers the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort, both UNESCO World Heritage Sites."},{"question":"Which languages are available for the guided tour?","answer":"Tour guide services are available in English, Spanish, German, Italian, and French."},{"question":"Is pickup and drop-off included?","answer":"Yes. Airport or hotel pickup and drop-off are included. Your chauffeur will return you to your hotel, the airport, or your given location in Jaipur."},{"question":"Are meals and monument entrance fees included?","answer":"Lunch, dinner, monument entrance fees, camera fees, and optional trips are excluded. Packaged drinking water bottles are provided in the car."}],"mapEmbedUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps?q=Taj+Mahal+Agra+India&output=embed","seo":{"title":"Private Same Day Taj Mahal Tour From Jaipur","description":"Visit the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort on a private same-day tour from Jaipur with a professional guide, AC car, and hotel or airport pickup and drop-off."},"draft":false,"breadcrumbImage":"assets/img/inner-page/breadcrumb/bg-4.jpg"}],"breadcrumbImage":""},{"name":"Golden Triangle Tour Guide","city":"golden-triangle","description":"Explore Delhi, Agra and Jaipur on a guided journey through three historic cities.","image":"/assets/img/home-1/tour/golden-triangle-tour-guide.webp","imageAlt":"","showOnMainGrid":true,"services":[{"name":"3 Days Golden Triangle Tour with Tour Guide","slug":"3-days-golden-triangle-tour-with-tour-guide","summary":"Explore Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on a private three-day tour with professional guides, Taj Mahal sunrise views. Finish in Jaipur, with an optional drop-off in Delhi.","description":"Discover the history and architecture of Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on this private 3 Days Golden Triangle Tour with Tour Guide. Explore Old Delhi's bazaars, visit Jama Masjid and Qutub Minar, and enjoy photo stops at the capital's landmarks before continuing to Agra.\n\nExperience the Taj Mahal at sunrise and explore Agra Fort with a professional guide. Continue to Jaipur to discover Amber Fort, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar, with photo stops at Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal.\n\nTravel in a private air-conditioned car with an experienced chauffeur. The tour ends with drop-off in Jaipur. An optional transfer to Delhi can be arranged on request. Guide services are available in English, Spanish, German, Italian, and French.\n\nHotel accommodation, breakfast, and all monument and heritage-site entry tickets are excluded and must be arranged or paid for separately.","location":"Delhi – Agra – Jaipur","duration":"3 days","groupSize":"Private tour","image":null,"imageAlt":"The Taj Mahal at sunrise during a three-day Golden Triangle tour","gallery":[],"highlights":["Explore Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on a private three-day tour.","Discover local history with professional tour guides.","Visit Jama Masjid and explore Old Delhi's bazaars on a rickshaw ride.","Enjoy photo stops at Delhi's landmarks and visit Qutub Minar.","Experience the Taj Mahal at sunrise and explore Agra Fort.","Visit Amber Fort, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar in Jaipur.","Stop for photographs at Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal.","Travel in a private air-conditioned car with an experienced chauffeur.","Finish with drop-off in Jaipur, with an optional Delhi transfer available on request."],"itinerary":[{"label":"Day 1","title":"Pickup in Delhi and Old Delhi Sightseeing","description":"Your tour guide and chauffeur will meet you at 8 am or your preferred time at your given location in Delhi.\n\nVisit Jama Masjid and explore Old Delhi's colourful bazaars on a rickshaw ride. Stop for exterior photographs at the Red Fort."},{"label":"Day 1","title":"New Delhi Landmarks and Qutub Minar","description":"Drive past New Delhi's government buildings and enjoy photo opportunities along the route, including India Gate, Rashtrapati Bhavan, and Parliament House, where access permits.\n\nContinue to Qutub Minar and explore the historic monument with your tour guide."},{"label":"Day 1","title":"Drive to Agra and Overnight Stay","description":"After your Delhi sightseeing, travel to Agra in your private air-conditioned car.\n\nCheck in to your separately booked hotel and stay overnight in Agra."},{"label":"Day 2","title":"Taj Mahal Sunrise Visit","description":"Meet your tour guide at the scheduled time of 6 am for an approximately 2–3 hour visit to the Taj Mahal. Coordinate the departure time with the seasonal sunrise.\n\nAdmire the white marble mausoleum from the outside and inside while your guide introduces its history, architecture, and decorative details."},{"label":"Day 2","title":"Breakfast, Hotel Check-out and Agra Fort","description":"Return to your separately booked hotel for breakfast at your own expense after visiting the Taj Mahal, then check out.\n\nVisit Agra Fort with your professional guide and explore its palaces, courtyards, and imposing architecture while learning about its Mughal history."},{"label":"Day 2","title":"Drive to Jaipur and Overnight Stay","description":"After exploring Agra Fort, continue to Jaipur in your private air-conditioned car.\n\nCheck in to your separately booked hotel and stay overnight in Jaipur."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Breakfast and Amber Fort","description":"After breakfast at your own expense, meet your professional tour guide at 8 am and begin your Jaipur sightseeing.\n\nExplore Amber Fort's courtyards, palaces, and architectural details while learning about its royal history."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal Photo Stops","description":"Stop for photographs at Jal Mahal, the palace set in Man Sagar Lake.\n\nContinue to Hawa Mahal, the Palace of Winds, for an exterior photo stop at its distinctive facade."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"City Palace and Jantar Mantar","description":"Visit City Palace in Jaipur's Old City and explore its royal heritage and museum collections, including textiles, costumes, and paintings.\n\nContinue to Jantar Mantar, the historic astronomical observatory, where your guide will explain its large instruments and their uses."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Drop-off in Jaipur or Optional Transfer to Delhi","description":"After your Jaipur sightseeing, your chauffeur will drop you at your separately booked hotel, Jaipur Airport, or your preferred location in Jaipur, where the standard tour ends.\n\nAn optional transfer to Delhi can be arranged in advance, with drop-off at your separately booked hotel, Delhi Airport, or your preferred location. Allow approximately 4–5 hours for the additional journey, depending on traffic. Confirm the transfer cost and departure timing when booking."}],"inclusions":["Transportation by private air-conditioned car for 