inated with the seasonal sunrise."},{"question":"Which attractions are covered in Jaipur?","answer":"The itinerary includes Amber Fort, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar, with exterior photo stops at Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal."},{"question":"Is hotel accommodation included?","answer":"No. Hotel accommodation is excluded. Please book your accommodation separately; hotel names in the itinerary are suggestions only."},{"question":"Which languages are available for the guided tour?","answer":"Tour guide services are available in English, Spanish, German, Italian, and French."},{"question":"Are meals included?","answer":"No. Breakfast, lunch, and dinner are excluded. Breakfast stops in the itinerary are at your own expense or covered by your separate hotel booking."},{"question":"Are monument entrance fees included?","answer":"No. All monument and heritage-site entry tickets are excluded and must be paid for separately."}],"mapEmbedUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps?q=Jaipur+India&output=embed","seo":{"title":"3 Days Golden Triangle Tour with Tour Guide","description":"Explore Delhi, Agra and Jaipur on a private 3-day tour with guides, Taj Mahal sunrise. Jaipur drop-off; optional Delhi transfer."},"draft":false,"breadcrumbImage":"assets/img/inner-page/breadcrumb/bg-4.jpg"},{"name":"4 Days Golden Triangle Tour with Tour Guide","slug":"4-days-golden-triangle-tour-with-tour-guide","summary":"Explore Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on a private four-day tour with professional guides, Taj Mahal sunrise views. Finish in Jaipur, with an optional drop-off in Delhi.","description":"Discover the history, culture, and architecture of Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on this private 4 Days Golden Triangle Tour with Tour Guide. Explore Old Delhi's bazaars, visit Jama Masjid and Qutub Minar, and enjoy photo stops at the capital's landmarks before travelling to Agra.\n\nExperience the Taj Mahal at sunrise and explore Agra Fort with a professional guide. Continue to Jaipur for visits to Amber Fort, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar, along with photo stops at Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal.\n\nTravel comfortably in a private air-conditioned car with an experienced chauffeur. The tour ends with drop-off in Jaipur on the fourth day, with an optional transfer to Delhi available on request. Guide services are available in English, Spanish, German, Italian, and French.\n\nHotel accommodation, breakfast, and all monument and heritage-site entry tickets are excluded and must be arranged or paid for separately.","location":"Delhi – Agra – Jaipur","duration":"4 days","groupSize":"Private tour","image":null,"imageAlt":"Amber Fort in Jaipur on a four-day Golden Triangle tour","gallery":[],"highlights":["Explore Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on a private four-day tour.","Discover local history with professional tour guides.","Visit Jama Masjid and explore Old Delhi's colourful bazaars on a rickshaw ride.","Enjoy photo stops at Delhi's landmarks and explore Qutub Minar.","Experience the Taj Mahal at sunrise and visit Agra Fort.","Explore Amber Fort, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar in Jaipur.","Stop for photographs at Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal.","Travel in a private air-conditioned car with an experienced chauffeur.","Finish in Jaipur on the fourth day, with an optional Delhi drop-off available on request."],"itinerary":[{"label":"Day 1","title":"Pickup in Delhi and Old Delhi Sightseeing","description":"Your tour guide and chauffeur will meet you at 8 am or your preferred time at your given location in Delhi.\n\nVisit Jama Masjid and explore Old Delhi's colourful bazaars on a rickshaw ride. Stop for exterior photographs at the Red Fort."},{"label":"Day 1","title":"New Delhi Landmarks and Qutub Minar","description":"Drive past New Delhi's landmarks, including India Gate, Rashtrapati Bhavan, and Parliament House, with photo opportunities where access permits.\n\nContinue to Qutub Minar and explore the historic complex with your professional tour guide."},{"label":"Day 1","title":"Drive to Agra and Overnight Stay","description":"After your Delhi sightseeing, travel to Agra in your private air-conditioned car.\n\nCheck in to your separately booked hotel and stay overnight in Agra."},{"label":"Day 2","title":"Taj Mahal Sunrise Visit","description":"Meet your tour guide at the scheduled time of 6 am for an approximately 2–3 hour visit to the Taj Mahal. Coordinate the departure time with the seasonal sunrise.\n\nAdmire the white marble mausoleum from the outside and inside as your guide shares its history and explains its architecture and decorative details."},{"label":"Day 2","title":"Breakfast, Hotel Check-out and Agra Fort","description":"Return to your separately booked hotel for breakfast at your own expense after visiting the Taj Mahal, then check out.\n\nExplore Agra Fort with your professional guide and discover its Mughal history, palaces, courtyards, and imposing architecture."},{"label":"Day 2","title":"Drive to Jaipur and Overnight Stay","description":"After exploring Agra Fort, continue to Jaipur in your private air-conditioned car.\n\nCheck in to your separately booked hotel for the first of two overnight stays in Jaipur."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Breakfast and Amber Fort","description":"After breakfast at your own expense, meet your professional tour guide at 8 am and begin your Jaipur sightseeing.\n\nVisit Amber Fort and explore its courtyards, palaces, and architectural details while learning about its royal heritage."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal Photo Stops","description":"Stop for photographs at Jal Mahal, the palace set in Man Sagar Lake.\n\nContinue to Hawa Mahal, the Palace of Winds, for an exterior photo stop at its distinctive facade."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"City Palace and Jantar Mantar","description":"Explore City Palace in Jaipur's Old City and discover its royal heritage and museum collections, including textiles, costumes, and paintings.\n\nContinue to Jantar Mantar, the historic astronomical observatory, where your guide will explain its large instruments and their uses."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Overnight Stay in Jaipur","description":"After your guided sightseeing, return to your separately booked hotel for your second overnight stay in Jaipur."},{"label":"Day 4","title":"Breakfast, Check-out and Jaipur Drop-off","description":"After breakfast at your own expense, check out of your separately booked hotel. Your chauffeur will transfer you to Jaipur Airport, another hotel, or your preferred location in Jaipur, where the standard tour ends.\n\nIf arranged in advance, you can choose an optional transfer to Delhi instead, with drop-off at your separately booked hotel, Delhi Airport, or your preferred location. Allow approximately 4–5 hours for the journey, depending on traffic. Confirm the transfer cost and departure timing when booking."}],"inclusions":["Transportation by private air-conditioned car for the Delhi – Agra – Jaipur itinerary","Experienced licensed driver","Services of professional tour guides for scheduled sightseeing in Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur","Airport or hotel pickup in Delhi","Hotel, airport, or preferred-location drop-off in Jaipur on Day 4","Packaged drinking water bottles in the car","Car parking and airport parking for the standard itinerary","Toll taxes, fuel, and driver allowance for the standard itinerary"],"exclusions":["Hotel accommodation","Breakfast, lunch, and dinner","All monument and heritage-site entry tickets","Camera fees","Any optional trip","Optional transfer and drop-off in Delhi, unless arranged and included in your booking","Anything not specified under the inclusions"],"faqs":[{"question":"Where does the tour start and end?","answer":"The tour starts with pickup in Delhi on the first day and ends with drop-off at Jaipur Airport, your hotel, or your preferred location in Jaipur on the fourth day."},{"question":"Can I choose a drop-off in Delhi instead of Jaipur?","answer":"Yes. An optional transfer from Jaipur to Delhi can be arranged on the fourth day. Confirm the transfer cost and timing when booking, as it is not included in the standard Delhi – Agra – Jaipur itinerary."},{"question":"How long is the tour?","answer":"The tour lasts four days and plans for three overnight stays: one in Agra and two in Jaipur. Accommodation is booked separately and is not included in the tour price."},{"question":"Which attractions are covered in Delhi?","answer":"The itinerary includes Jama Masjid, a rickshaw ride through Old Delhi's bazaars, an exterior photo stop at the Red Fort, and a visit to Qutub Minar. You will also drive past New Delhi's landmarks, with photo opportunities where access permits."},{"question":"Does the tour include the Taj Mahal at sunrise?","answer":"Yes. A sunrise visit to the Taj Mahal is planned for the second day, followed by breakfast, hotel check-out, and a guided visit to Agra Fort. The departure time should be coordinated with the seasonal sunrise."},{"question":"Which attractions are covered in Jaipur?","answer":"Jaipur sightseeing includes Amber Fort, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar, along with exterior photo stops at Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal."},{"question":"What is planned for the fourth day?","answer":"After breakfast and hotel check-out, you will be dropped at Jaipur Airport, your hotel, or your preferred location in Jaipur. If booked in advance, you can take an optional transfer to Delhi instead."},{"question":"Is hotel accommodation included?","answer":"No. Hotel accommodation is excluded. Please book your accommodation separately; hotel names in the itinerary are suggestions only."},{"question":"Which languages are available for the guided tour?","answer":"Tour guide services are available in English, Spanish, German, Italian, and French."},{"question":"Are meals included?","answer":"No. Breakfast, lunch, and dinner are excluded. Breakfast stops in the itinerary are at your own expense or covered by your separate hotel booking."},{"question":"Are monument entrance fees included?","answer":"No. All monument and heritage-site entry tickets are excluded and must be paid for separately."}],"mapEmbedUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps?q=Jaipur+India&output=embed","seo":{"title":"4 Days Golden Triangle Tour with Tour Guide","description":"Explore Delhi, Agra and Jaipur on a private 4-day tour with guides, Taj Mahal sunrise. Jaipur drop-off; optional Delhi transfer."},"draft":false,"breadcrumbImage":"assets/img/inner-page/breadcrumb/bg-4.jpg"},{"name":"5 Days Golden Triangle Tour with Tour Guide","slug":"5-days-golden-triangle-tour-with-tour-guide","summary":"Explore Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on a private five-day tour with professional guides, Taj Mahal sunrise and sunset views. Finish in Jaipur, with an optional Delhi drop-off.","description":"Discover the history, culture, and architecture of Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on this private 5 Days Golden Triangle Tour with Tour Guide. Explore Old Delhi's bazaars, visit Jama Masjid and Qutub Minar, and enjoy photo stops at the capital's landmarks.\n\nContinue to Agra to explore Agra Fort and enjoy sunset views of the Taj Mahal from Mehtab Bagh. Visit the Taj Mahal at sunrise the following morning, then discover Fatehpur Sikri on your journey to Jaipur.\n\nExplore Jaipur's Amber Fort, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar, with photo stops at Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal. Travel in a private air-conditioned car with an experienced chauffeur.\n\nThe tour ends with drop-off in Jaipur on the fifth day. An optional transfer to Delhi can be arranged on request. Guide services are available in English, Spanish, German, Italian, and French.\n\nHotel accommodation, breakfast, and all monument and heritage-site entry tickets are excluded and must be arranged or paid for separately.","location":"Delhi – Agra – Jaipur","duration":"5 days","groupSize":"Private tour","image":null,"imageAlt":"The Taj Mahal viewed across the Yamuna River from Mehtab Bagh at sunset","gallery":[],"highlights":["Explore Delhi, Agra, and Jai