 with your tour guide and discover its Mughal history, palaces, courtyards, and imposing architecture.\n\nAfter your visit, you can stop for lunch at your own expense."},{"label":"Day 2","title":"Mehtab Bagh Sunset Views and Overnight Stay","description":"In the evening, visit Mehtab Bagh for sunset views of the Taj Mahal across the Yamuna River.\n\nAfter your visit, transfer to your separately booked hotel for an overnight stay in Agra."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Taj Mahal Sunrise Visit","description":"Meet your tour guide at the scheduled time of 6 am for an approximately 2–3 hour visit to the Taj Mahal. Coordinate the departure time with the seasonal sunrise.\n\nAdmire the white marble mausoleum from the outside and inside while your guide shares its history and explains its architecture and decorative details."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Breakfast, Hotel Check-out and Fatehpur Sikri","description":"Return to your separately booked hotel for breakfast at your own expense after visiting the Taj Mahal, then check out and begin your journey towards Jaipur.\n\nStop en route at Fatehpur Sikri, the historic red sandstone city that once served as Mughal Emperor Akbar's capital. Explore its preserved buildings with your tour guide."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Continue to Jaipur and Overnight Stay","description":"After exploring Fatehpur Sikri, continue to Jaipur in your private air-conditioned car.\n\nCheck in to your separately booked hotel for the first of two overnight stays in Jaipur."},{"label":"Day 4","title":"Breakfast and Amber Fort","description":"After breakfast at your own expense, meet your professional tour guide at 8 am and begin your Jaipur sightseeing.\n\nVisit Amber Fort and explore its courtyards, palaces, and architectural details while learning about its royal heritage."},{"label":"Day 4","title":"Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal Photo Stops","description":"Stop for photographs at Jal Mahal, the palace set in Man Sagar Lake.\n\nContinue to Hawa Mahal, the Palace of Winds, for an exterior photo stop at its distinctive facade."},{"label":"Day 4","title":"City Palace and Jantar Mantar","description":"Explore City Palace in Jaipur's Old City and discover its royal heritage and museum collections, including textiles, costumes, and paintings.\n\nContinue to Jantar Mantar, the historic astronomical observatory, where your guide will explain its large instruments and their uses."},{"label":"Day 4","title":"Overnight Stay in Jaipur","description":"After your guided sightseeing, return to your separately booked hotel for your second overnight stay in Jaipur."},{"label":"Day 5","title":"Breakfast, Check-out and Jaipur Drop-off","description":"After breakfast at your own expense, check out of your separately booked hotel. Your chauffeur will transfer you to Jaipur Airport, another hotel, or your preferred location in Jaipur, where the standard tour ends.\n\nIf arranged in advance, you can choose an optional transfer to Delhi instead, with drop-off at your separately booked hotel, Delhi Airport, or your preferred location. Journey time depends on traffic and your drop-off location. Confirm the transfer cost and departure timing when booking."}],"inclusions":["Transportation by private air-conditioned car for the Delhi – Agra – Jaipur itinerary","Experienced licensed driver","Services of professional tour guides for scheduled sightseeing in Delhi, Agra, Fatehpur Sikri, and Jaipur","Airport or hotel pickup in Delhi","Hotel, airport, or preferred-location drop-off in Jaipur on Day 5","Packaged drinking water bottles in the car","Car parking and airport parking for the standard itinerary","Toll taxes, fuel, and driver allowance for the standard itinerary"],"exclusions":["Hotel accommodation","Breakfast, lunch, and dinner","All monument and heritage-site entry tickets","Camera fees","Any optional trip","Optional transfer and drop-off in Delhi, unless arranged and included in your booking","Anything not specified under the inclusions"],"