paid for separately."}],"mapEmbedUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps?q=Jaipur+India&output=embed","seo":{"title":"6 Days Golden Triangle Tour with Tour Guide","description":"Explore Delhi, Agra and Jaipur on a private 6-day tour with guides, Taj Mahal sunrise. Jaipur drop-off; optional Delhi transfer."},"draft":false,"breadcrumbImage":"assets/img/inner-page/breadcrumb/bg-4.jpg"},{"name":"Luxury Golden Triangle Tour India","slug":"luxury-golden-triangle-tour-india","summary":"Discover Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on a private six-day luxury tour with expert guides and a chauffeured SUV. Finish in Jaipur, with an optional Delhi drop-off.","description":"Experience Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on a private six-day Luxury Golden Triangle Tour India, designed around your interests, pace, and preferred hotels. Discover the capital's historic landmarks and lively bazaars before continuing to Agra for sunset views of the Taj Mahal from Mehtab Bagh and a guided sunrise visit the following morning.\n\nExplore Agra Fort and visit Fatehpur Sikri on the journey to Jaipur. Abhaneri's Chand Baori stepwell can be arranged as an alternative or additional stop according to your preferences and schedule. In Jaipur, discover Amber Fort, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar, with photo stops at Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal.\n\nTravel in a private air-conditioned SUV with an experienced chauffeur and explore the agreed itinerary with professional guides.\n\nThe tour ends with drop-off in Jaipur on the sixth day. An optional transfer to Delhi can be arranged on request. Guide services are available in English, Spanish, German, Italian, and French. Hotels, sightseeing, destinations, and tour length can be tailored to your preferences and budget.\n\nHotel accommodation, breakfast, and all monument and heritage-site entry tickets are excluded and must be arranged or paid for separately.","location":"Delhi – Agra – Fatehpur Sikri or Abhaneri – Jaipur","duration":"6 days","groupSize":"Private tour","image":null,"imageAlt":"The Taj Mahal at sunrise on a private luxury Golden Triangle tour","gallery":[],"highlights":["Explore Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on a private six-day luxury tour.","Discover local history with professional private tour guides.","Explore Old Delhi's bazaars on a rickshaw ride and visit the capital's historic landmarks.","Enjoy sunset views of the Taj Mahal from Mehtab Bagh and a guided sunrise visit.","Explore Agra Fort and discover Fatehpur Sikri en route to Jaipur.","Choose Abhaneri's Chand Baori as an alternative or additional stop by prior arrangement.","Visit Amber Fort, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar in Jaipur.","Travel in a private air-conditioned SUV with an experienced chauffeur.","Customise your hotels, sightseeing, and optional experiences.","Finish in Jaipur, with an optional Delhi drop-off available on request."],"itinerary":[{"label":"Day 1","title":"Arrival in Delhi and Luxury Hotel Check-in","description":"A member of the team will welcome you at Delhi Airport, and your chauffeur will transfer you to your separately booked hotel.\n\nSuggested hotels for separate booking include The Imperial, The Leela Palace New Delhi, or The Oberoi, New Delhi, according to your preferences and availability.\n\nIf you arrive early, introductory sightseeing can be arranged according to the available time. Stay overnight in Delhi."},{"label":"Day 2","title":"Old Delhi Sightseeing and Sikh Temple Visit","description":"After breakfast at your own expense, meet your professional tour guide and chauffeur at your separately booked hotel.\n\nVisit Jama Masjid, explore Old Delhi's colourful bazaars on a rickshaw ride, and stop for exterior photographs at the Red Fort. Continue with a visit to a Sikh temple."},{"label":"Day 2","title":"New Delhi Landmarks and Qutub Minar","description":"Drive past New Delhi's landmarks, including India Gate, Rashtrapati Bhavan, and Parliament House, with photo opportunities where access permits.\n\nVisit Qutub Minar with your guide before returning to your separately booked hotel for your second overnight stay in Delhi. Dinner arrangements can be discussed separately; dinner is not included."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Drive to Agra and Hotel Check-in","description":"After breakfast at your own expense, check out and travel to Agra in your private air-conditioned SUV. The journey takes approximately 3–4 hours, depending on traffic.\n\nCheck in to your separately booked hotel and take time to relax. Suggested hotels for separate booking include Tajview, Trident Agra, or ITC Mughal. The Oberoi Amarvilas can be requested as a premium option, subject to availability and your separate hotel booking."},{"label":"Day 3","title":"Agra Fort and Taj Mahal Sunset Views","description":"Meet your professional guide and explore Agra Fort, discovering its Mughal history, palaces, and courtyards.\n\nIn the evening, visit Mehtab Bagh for sunset views of the Taj Mahal across the Yamuna River. Return to your separately booked hotel for an overnight stay in Agra."},{"label":"Day 4","title":"Taj Mahal Sunrise Visit","description":"Meet your tour guide at the scheduled time of 6 am for an approximately 2–3 hour visit to the Taj Mahal. Coordinate the departure time with the seasonal sunrise.\n\nAdmire the white marble mausoleum from the outside and inside while your guide explains its history, architecture, and decorative details. Return to your separately booked hotel for breakfast at your own expense before checking out."},{"label":"Day 4","title":"Fatehpur Sikri or Abhaneri and Drive to Jaipur","description":"Travel towards Jaipur with a guided visit to Fatehpur Sikri, the historic red sandstone city that once served as Mughal Emperor Akbar's capital.\n\nIf preferred, a visit to Chand Baori in Abhaneri can be arranged as an alternative. Visiting both sites can also be discussed in advance, subject to journey time and your agreed itinerary."},{"label":"Day 4","title":"Luxury Hotel Check-in and Overnight in Jaipur","description":"Upon arrival in Jaipur, check in to your separately booked hotel. Options include ITC Rajputana, Trident Jaipur, or the heritage property Samode Haveli.\n\nRambagh Palace or The Oberoi Rajvilas can be requested as premium options, subject to availability and your separate hotel booking. Enjoy the first of two overnight stays in Jaipur."},{"label":"Day 5","title":"Amber Fort and Jaipur Photo Stops","description":"After breakfast at your own expense, meet your professional tour guide at 8 am and begin your Jaipur sightseeing with a visit to Amber Fort.\n\nExplore its courtyards and palaces, then stop for photographs at Jal Mahal and the distinctive facade of Hawa Mahal."},{"label":"Day 5","title":"City Palace and Jantar Mantar","description":"Visit City Palace in Jaipur's Old City and discover its royal heritage and museum collections, including textiles, costumes, and paintings.\n\nContinue to Jantar Mantar, where your guide will explain the observatory's large astronomical instruments and their uses."},{"label":"Day 5","title":"Optional Evening Experience and Overnight Stay","description":"Personalise your evening with an optional experience, such as a cooking class or the elephant encounter described in your customised proposal. No elephant riding is planned.\n\nAny optional activity, its arrangements, and its cost should be confirmed before booking. You may also leave the evening free to relax. Stay overnight in Jaipur."},{"label":"Day 6","title":"Breakfast, Check-out and Jaipur Drop-off","description":"After breakfast at your own expense, check out of your separately booked hotel. Your chauffeur will transfer you to Jaipur Airport, another hotel, or your preferred location in Jaipur, where the standard tour ends.\n\nAn optional transfer to Delhi can be arranged in advance, with drop-off at Delhi Airport, your separately booked hotel, or your preferred location. Confirm the transfer cost and departure timing when booking, allowing sufficient time for traffic and any onward flight."}],"inclusions":["Private air-conditioned SUV with an experienced licensed chauffeur for the standard itinerary","Services of professional tour guides for scheduled sightseeing","Airport pickup and hotel transfer in Delhi","Hotel, airport, or preferred-location drop-off in Jaipur on Day 6","Packaged drinking water bottles in the vehicle","Car parking and airport parking for the standard itinerary","Toll taxes, fuel, and chauffeur allowance for the standard itinerary"],"exclusions":["Hotel accommodation","Breakfast, lunch, and dinner","All monument and heritage-site entry tickets","Optional activities, excursions, and itinerary additions unless included in your booking","Optional transfer and drop-off in Delhi, unless arranged and included in your booking","Hotel upgrades beyond your confirmed package","Anything not specified under the inclusions"],"faqs":[{"question":"Where does the Luxury Golden Triangle Tour start and end?","answer":"The tour starts with airport pickup in Delhi and ends with drop-off at Jaipur Airport, another hotel, or your preferred location in Jaipur on the sixth day."},{"question":"Can I choose a drop-off in Delhi instead of Jaipur?","answer":"Yes. An optional transfer from Jaipur to Delhi can be arranged on the sixth day. Confirm the transfer cost and departure timing when booking, as it is not included in the standard itinerary."},{"question":"How many nights of accommodation should I arrange?","answer":"Please arrange five nights separately: two in Delhi, one in Agra, and two in Jaipur. Accommodation is excluded from the tour price."},{"question":"Which hotels can I choose?","answer":"Options include The Imperial, The Leela Palace, or The Oberoi in Delhi; Tajview, Trident, ITC Mughal, or The Oberoi Amarvilas in Agra; and ITC Rajputana, Trident, Samode Haveli, Rambagh Palace, or The Oberoi Rajvilas in Jaipur. These are suggestions only; hotel bookings and costs are separate from the tour package."},{"question":"Are breakfast and monument entrance tickets included?","answer":"No. Breakfast and all monument and heritage-site entry tickets are excluded and must be paid for separately. Lunch and dinner are also excluded."},{"question":"What vehicle is provided?","answer":"The standard itinerary includes a private air-conditioned SUV with an experienced licensed chauffeur."},{"question":"Will I see the Taj Mahal at sunrise and sunset?","answer":"Yes. The itinerary includes sunset views from Mehtab Bagh on the third day and a guided visit inside the Taj Mahal at sunrise on the fourth day. The morning departure time should be coordinated with the seasonal sunrise."},{"question":"Can I visit Abhaneri instead of Fatehpur Sikri?","answer":"Yes. Chand Baori in Abhaneri can be arranged as an alternative stop on the journey to Jaipur. Visiting both sites can also be discussed in advance, subject to available time and your agreed itinerary."},{"question":"Are evening experiences in Jaipur included?","answer":"Evening experiences, such as a cooking class or an elephant encounter, are optional. Their arrangements and costs must be confirmed separately unless included in your booking. Elephant riding is not planned."},{"question":"Can this tour be customised?","answer":"Yes. Hotels, sightseeing, destinations, optional experiences, and tour length can be tailored to your preferences, schedule, and budget."},{"question":"Which languages are available for the guided tour?","answer":"Tour guide services are available in English, Spanish, German, Italian, and French."}],"mapEmbedUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps?q=Jaipur+India&output=embed","seo":{"title":"Luxury Golden Triangle Tour India | 6 Days","description":"Discover Delhi, Agra and Jaipur with private guides, SUV travel and tailored sightseeing. Jaipur drop-off; optional Delhi transfer."},"draft":false,"breadcrumbImage":"assets/img/inner-page/breadcrumb/bg-4.jpg"},{"name":"Luxury Golden Triangle Tour with Heritage Hotels","slug":"luxury-golden-triangle-tour-with-heritage-hotels","summary":"Explore Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on a private six-day tour with professional guides, Taj Mahal sunrise and sunset views, and heritage hotel suggestions. Finish with drop-off in Jaipur. Accommodation is booked separately.","description":"Discover Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on this private six-day Luxury Golden Triangle Tour with Heritage Hotels. Combine guided sightseeing with the opportunity to stay at heritage properties and luxury hotels selected according to your preferences and budget. Hotel accommodation is not included in the tour package and is booked separately.\n\nExplore Old Delhi's bazaars, Jama Masjid, a Sikh temple, and Qutub Minar. Continue to Agra for a guided visit to Agra Fort, sunset views of the Taj Mahal from Mehtab Bagh, and a sunrise visit to the mausoleum the following morning.\n\nVisit Fatehpur Sikri on your journey to Jaipur, with Abhaneri's Chand Baori available as an alternative or additional stop by prior arrangement. Discover Jaipur's Amber Fort, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar, with photo stops at Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal.\n\nTravel in a private air-conditioned car with an experienced chauffeur. The tour ends with drop-off in Jaipur on the sixth day. Guide services are available in English, Spanish, German, Italian, and French. Sightseeing, hotel suggestions, and tour length can be tailored to your preferences.\n\nHotel accommodation, breakfast, and all monument and heritage-site entry tickets are excluded and must be arranged or paid for separately.","location":"Delhi – Agra – Fatehpur Sikri or Abhaneri – Jaipur","duration":"6 days","groupSize":"Private tour","image":null,"imageAlt":"Heritage architecture in Jaipur on a luxury Golden Triangle tour","gallery":[],"highlights":["Explore Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur on a private six-day tour.","Choose from suggested heritage and luxury hotels, booked separately.","Discover local history with professional tour guides.","Visit Jama Masjid and explor