tyards and palaces, then stop for photographs at Jal Mahal and the distinctive facade of Hawa Mahal."},{"label":"Day 5","title":"City Palace and Jantar Mantar","description":"Visit City Palace in Jaipur's Old City and discover its royal heritage and museum collections, including textiles, costumes, and paintings.\n\nContinue to Jantar Mantar, where your guide will explain the observatory's large astronomical instruments and their uses."},{"label":"Day 5","title":"Optional Evening Experience and Overnight Stay","description":"Personalise your evening with an optional cooking class or an elephant encounter, with arrangements and costs confirmed in advance. Elephant riding is not planned.\n\nYou may also leave the evening free to relax. Return to your separately booked hotel for your second overnight stay in Jaipur."},{"label":"Day 6","title":"Breakfast, Check-out and Jaipur Drop-off","description":"After breakfast at your own expense, check out of your separately booked hotel. Your chauffeur will transfer you to Jaipur Airport, another hotel, or your preferred location in Jaipur.\n\nYour Luxury Golden Triangle Tour with Heritage Hotels ends in Jaipur."}],"inclusions":["Transportation by private air-conditioned car for the Delhi – Agra – Jaipur itinerary","Experienced licensed driver","Services of professional tour guides for scheduled sightseeing","Airport or hotel pickup in Delhi","Hotel, airport, or preferred-location drop-off in Jaipur on Day 6","Packaged drinking water bottles in the car","Car parking and airport parking for the agreed itinerary","Toll taxes, fuel, and driver allowance"],"exclusions":["Hotel accommodation","Breakfast, lunch, and dinner","All monument and heritage-site entry tickets","Optional activities and excursions unless included in your booking","Anything not specified under the inclusions"],"faqs":[{"question":"Where does the tour start and end?","answer":"The tour starts with airport or hotel pickup in Delhi and ends with drop-off at Jaipur